0..76 Comment "// A theory\'s laws stated as the path types they are, `law name : type`: the"
77..150 Comment "// equations a model proves, where a rule is a rewrite the theory orients"
151..225 Comment "// (#2356). Reflexivity, symmetry and transitivity of a decision, the last"
226..300 Comment "// under two hypotheses, none of which a rule could state: symmetry has no"
301..380 Comment "// orientation and reflexivity\'s left side reads its variable twice. A model at"
381..454 Comment "// a type of its own proves each law by a definition at the law\'s path; a"
455..526 Comment "// model at a host primitive admits each, `law refl admitted;`, and the"
527..604 Comment "// report\'s audit lists the admission in place of an obligation. A model that"
605..684 Comment "// leaves a law out has the checker discharge it: `Path.here` at the law\'s left"
685..758 Comment "// side, where its sides convert (#4112). A theory including a lawful one"
759..834 Comment "// restricts its models to the included theory\'s, the laws carried by name."
835..908 Comment "// The refusals are beside `../../pathological/modules/model-laws.gandr`."
910..966 Comment "/// A decision and the laws that make it an equivalence."
